<section>
  <grid spacing="small">
    <grid-item colspan="18" background-color="surface" padding="44pt 28pt 40pt 48pt">
      <h2>CUT 02 / The Veil</h2>
      <hr horizontalAlign="left" width="xs" thickness="md" color="accent"/>
      <p>Curtain fringe opens at the cheekbone; long face-framing layers merge into a soft U-shaped length. The effect is fluid rather than heavily feathered.</p>
      <spacer mode="fill"/>
      <p role="caption">AI concept imagery — not salon work.</p>
    </grid-item>
    <grid-item colspan="21" padding="0">
      <ai-image background="true" aspect-ratio="portrait" image-style="sculptural-hair-editorial" prompt="Medium-format fashion beauty photograph of an adult South Asian model facing forward with long dark hair fully visible, curtain fringe opening precisely at both cheekbones and merging into restrained face-framing layers, warm directional studio light, gallery-cream background, rose-clay wardrobe, realistic strands and subtle film grain, no hands or accessories near the hair, no text or lettering"></ai-image>
    </grid-item>
    <grid-item colspan="21" padding="0">
